<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Helion — Monitoramento e gestão de energia solar</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<template id="__bundler_thumbnail" data-bg-color="#06080A">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <rect width="1200" height="800" fill="#06080A"/>
    <g transform="translate(600 400)">
      <path d="M0 -150 L130 -75 L130 75 L0 150 L-130 75 L-130 -75 Z" fill="none" stroke="#F3F6F4" stroke-width="22" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="66" fill="#00C853"/>
      <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="66" fill="none" stroke="#D5FF3A" stroke-width="9"/>
    </g>
    <text x="600" y="640" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-weight="600" font-size="60" fill="#F3F6F4" letter-spacing="-2">helion</text>
  </svg>
</template>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg:#06080A; --bg-1:#0B0F12; --bg-2:#11161A; --bg-3:#181F24; --panel:#0E1316;
    --line:#1E262C; --line-2:#2A343B; --white:#F3F6F4; --ink-2:#9BA7AD; --ink-3:#66727A;
    --green:#00C853; --green-d:#009C3B; --green-l:#1DE074; --neon:#D5FF3A; --neon-2:#C2F02A;
    --lilac:#B49BF0; --red:#FF4D5E; --orange:#FF9F2E;
    --max:1280px; --r-sm:8px; --r-md:14px; --r-lg:20px; --r-xl:32px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--white); font-family: "Geist", system-ui, -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-x: hidden; }
  ::selection { background: var(--neon); color: #06080A; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
  .wrap { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }
  .mono { font-family: "Geist Mono", ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .serif-i { font-family: "Instrument Serif", "Times New Roman", serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; }
  .grid-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; background-image: linear-gradient(color-mix(in oklab, var(--line) 60%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in oklab, var(--line) 60%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 56px 56px; -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 75%); mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 75%); }

  .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-size: 22px; color: var(--white); }
  .logo .mark { width: 30px; height: 30px; flex-shrink: 0; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px color-mix(in oklab, var(--neon) 45%, transparent)); }

  .nav { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 60; background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--bg) 78%, transparent); backdrop-filter: saturate(150%) blur(14px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 70px; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.15s; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }
  .nav-cta { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }

  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.005em; border: 1px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; font-family: inherit; }
  .btn-neon { background: var(--neon); color: #06080A; }
  .btn-neon:hover { background: var(--neon-2); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -8px color-mix(in oklab, var(--neon) 70%, transparent); }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--white); border-color: var(--line-2); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--ink-2); background: var(--bg-2); }
  .arrow::after { content: "→"; margin-left: 4px; transition: transform 0.15s ease; }
  .arrow:hover::after { transform: translateX(3px); }

  /* HERO */
  .hero { position: relative; padding: 84px 0 70px; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-aura { position: absolute; top: -300px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 1100px; height: 700px; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 40%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--green) 30%, transparent) 0%, transparent 55%), radial-gradient(circle at 70% 55%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--lilac) 20%, transparent) 0%, transparent 55%); filter: blur(60px); opacity: 0.7; }
  .hero .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .hero-top { text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 7px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius: 999px; background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--bg-2) 70%, transparent); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .eyebrow .live { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green-l); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  @keyframes pulse { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 color-mix(in oklab, var(--green-l) 60%, transparent); } 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px transparent; } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 transparent; } }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 5.6vw, 78px); line-height: 1.18; letter-spacing: -0.04em; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .hero h1 .hl-neon { color: var(--neon); }
  .hero h1 .hl-green { color: var(--green-l); }
  .hero p.lede { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 62ch; margin: 0 auto 34px; }
  .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* AUDIENCE SWITCH */
  .switch-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: 52px; }
  .switch { display: inline-flex; gap: 4px; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px; }
  .switch button { border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--ink-2); font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; padding: 11px 22px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .switch button.active { background: var(--neon); color: #06080A; }

  /* MATRIX */
  section { padding: 108px 0; position: relative; }
  .sec-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--neon); }
  .sec-tag::before { content: ""; width: 24px; height: 1px; background: var(--neon); }
  .head-center { text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
  .head-center h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 56px); letter-spacing: -0.036em; line-height: 1.03; font-weight: 500; margin: 0; }
  .head-center h2 .serif-i { color: var(--green-l); }
  .head-center p { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }

  .matrix { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 1fr; gap: 2px; background: var(--line); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .matrix > div { background: var(--bg-1); padding: 26px 24px; }
  .matrix .corner { background: var(--bg-2); }
  .matrix .col-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; justify-content: center; }
  .matrix .col-head b { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .matrix .col-head span { font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .matrix .row-head { display: flex; align-items: center; background: var(--bg-2); }
  .matrix .row-head b { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; }
  .matrix .cell { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .matrix .cell:hover { background: var(--bg-2); }
  .matrix .cell .plan-name { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-l); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .matrix .cell p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
  .matrix .cell .price { font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--neon); margin-top: 4px; }

  /* PLANS */
  .plan-group { display: none; }
  .plan-group.active { display: block; }
  .plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .plan { border: 1px solid var(--line-2); background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-1), var(--bg)); border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 34px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s; }
  .plan:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .plan.featured { border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--neon) 50%, transparent); background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-2), var(--bg-1)); box-shadow: 0 30px 70px -30px color-mix(in oklab, var(--green) 40%, transparent); }
  .plan .ptag { font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 22px; padding-right: 0; }
  .plan.featured .ptag { color: var(--neon); }
  .badge-pop { display: inline-block; position: static; background: var(--neon); color: #06080A; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .plan h3 { font-size: 27px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .plan .dor { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 24px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .plan .dor b { color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; }
  .plan .price { font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 2px; line-height: 1; }
  .plan .price .per { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 400; }
  .plan .cap { font-size: 13px; margin: 14px 0 22px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .plan ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 26px; flex: 1; }
  .plan ul li { padding: 7px 0; font-size: 14px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .plan ul li::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--green-l); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; }
  .plan.featured ul li::before { color: var(--neon); }
  .plan .btn { justify-content: center; width: 100%; }
  .plan .anchor { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.5; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; }
  .plan .anchor b { color: var(--ink-2); }

  /* B2B degressividade */
  .degress-wrap { margin-top: 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  .degress { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 26px 28px; }
  .degress h4 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .degress .sub { font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 18px; display: block; }
  .degress table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .degress td { padding: 10px 0; font-size: 13.5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .degress tr:first-child td { border-top: none; }
  .degress td:first-child { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .degress td:last-child { text-align: right; font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; color: var(--green-l); font-weight: 500; }
  .degress .note { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.5; }

  .plans-note { text-align: center; color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 30px; }

  /* WHY / LACUNA */
  .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
  .why-card { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-2), var(--bg-1)); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-xl); padding: 40px; }
  .why-card .stat { font-family: "Instrument Serif", serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 64px; color: var(--green-l); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .why-card p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .why h3 { font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 46px); letter-spacing: -0.032em; line-height: 1.04; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .why p.body { font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  .why-points { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .why-points li { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .why-points li b { color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; }
  .why-points li .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--neon); margin-top: 7px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .faq details { padding: 26px 28px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg-1); }
  .faq details summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .faq details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq details summary::after { content: "+"; font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; font-size: 20px; color: var(--green-l); transition: transform 0.2s ease; font-weight: 600; }
  .faq details[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .faq details p { margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 54ch; }

  /* CTA */
  .cta { text-align: center; padding: 150px 0 120px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .cta-aura { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--green) 24%, transparent), transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 75% 55%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--lilac) 16%, transparent), transparent 50%); }
  .cta .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .cta h2 { font-size: clamp(46px, 6.6vw, 100px); letter-spacing: -0.045em; line-height: 0.95; font-weight: 500; margin: 22px auto 24px; max-width: 16ch; }
  .cta h2 .hl { color: var(--neon); }
  .cta p { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 18px; max-width: 50ch; margin: 0 auto 38px; }

  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 40px 0 32px; }
  .foot-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .foot-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .foot-links a { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .foot-links a:hover { color: var(--neon); }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .plans, .why-grid, .degress-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .matrix { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .matrix .row-head { display: none; }
    .matrix .corner { display: none; }
    .matrix .col-head { text-align: center; }
    .faq { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .wrap { padding: 0 20px; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    section { padding: 76px 0; }
    .foot-bottom { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .switch { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
  <defs>
    <symbol id="helion-mark" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
      <path d="M50 7 L84.5 27 L84.5 73 L50 93 L15.5 73 L15.5 27 Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="17.5" fill="#00C853"/>
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="17.5" fill="none" stroke="#D5FF3A" stroke-width="2.4"/>
    </symbol>
  </defs>
</svg>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <a class="logo" href="#"><svg class="mark" style="color:var(--white)"><use href="#helion-mark"/></svg><span>helion</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#matriz">A plataforma</a>
      <a href="#planos">Planos</a>
      <a href="#porque">Por que existe</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#">Entrar</a>
      <a class="btn btn-neon" href="#planos">Ver planos</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-aura"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-top">
      <span class="eyebrow mono"><span class="live"></span>Monitoramento + gestão de energia solar</span>
      <h1>Sua usina para de gerar <span class="hl-neon">e ninguém te avisa.</span><br/>O Helion <span class="hl-green serif-i">avisa.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Falhas silenciosas e créditos não compensados custam caro todo mês — e só aparecem quando a conta já chegou.
        O Helion monitora sua usina em tempo real, alerta no WhatsApp e confere se a geração virou desconto na fatura.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#planos" class="btn btn-neon">Ver planos e preços</a>
        <a href="#matriz" class="btn btn-ghost arrow">Entender a plataforma</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- MATRIX -->
<section id="matriz">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head-center">
      <span class="sec-tag" style="justify-content:center;">Como a plataforma se organiza</span>
      <h2>Duas perguntas. <span class="serif-i">Dois públicos.</span> Quatro planos.</h2>
      <p>O Helion não tenta ser tudo para todos — ele resolve exatamente duas dores, para exatamente dois perfis de cliente.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="matrix">
      <div class="corner"></div>
      <div class="col-head"><b>"Minha usina está funcionando?"</b><span>Monitorar a geração</span></div>
      <div class="col-head"><b>"A geração virou desconto na conta?"</b><span>Garantir a compensação</span></div>

      <div class="row-head"><b>Dono de usina<br/>(pessoa física ou empresa)</b></div>
      <div class="cell">
        <span class="plan-name">Helion Monitor</span>
        <p>Alerta no WhatsApp quando a usina falha — resolve descobrir semanas depois que parou de gerar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <span class="plan-name">Monitor + Fatura</span>
        <p>Audita a fatura da concessionária e confere a compensação em todas as UCs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="row-head"><b>Empresa que gerencia<br/>usinas de terceiros</b></div>
      <div class="cell">
        <span class="plan-name">Helion Integrador</span>
        <p>Monitora a carteira de clientes num painel só e revende o app com a marca do integrador.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <span class="plan-name">Helion Gestor</span>
        <p>Audita a compensação de centenas de UCs beneficiárias e gerencia o rateio de créditos.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PLANS -->
<section id="planos" style="background:var(--bg-1);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head-center">
      <span class="sec-tag" style="justify-content:center;">Planos e preços</span>
      <h2>Escolha pelo <span class="serif-i">seu perfil.</span></h2>
      <p>Preços de entrada abertos. Acima do volume de entrada nos planos B2B, atendimento consultivo.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="switch-wrap">
      <div class="switch">
        <button id="btn-b2c" class="active">Tenho uma usina</button>
        <button id="btn-b2b">Gerencio usinas de terceiros</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:52px;">
      <!-- B2C -->
      <div class="plan-group active" id="group-b2c">
        <div class="plans">
          <div class="plan">
            <div class="ptag">Dono de usina · residencial ou comercial</div>
            <h3>Helion Monitor</h3>
            <p class="dor"><b>A dor:</b> você só descobre que a usina parou de gerar quando a conta chega alta — às vezes semanas de geração perdida.</p>
            <div class="price">R$ 19,90 <span class="per">/mês</span></div>
            <div class="cap">Comercial (até 3 usinas): R$ 34,90/mês · Anual com 2 meses grátis: R$ 199</div>
            <ul>
              <li>Monitoramento em tempo real</li>
              <li>Alerta no WhatsApp quando a usina falha</li>
              <li>Histórico de geração</li>
              <li>Relatório mensal</li>
              <li>14 dias de teste grátis</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost">Começar teste grátis</a>
            <div class="anchor"><b>Por que este preço:</b> serviços regionais cobram ~R$ 39,90/mês com atendimento humano. Um app self-service custa cerca da metade.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan featured">
